3. Chapter on  TNC&apos;s  Vulnerability of key sectors assessed and adaptation measures proposed.
4. Chapter on TNC&apos;s establishment of domestic measurement, reporting and verification system supported. 
5. Chapter on TNC&apos;s national circumstances and intuitional arrangement, constraints and gaps, other information  relevant to the preparation of NC, and BUR
6. Chapter on 7. TNC and FBUR compiled, endorsed by the Government and submitted, project regularly monitored, financial audit conducted and lessons learned compiled.

